# Python rules
- Python 3.11+, type hints on all functions; pass `ruff` and `mypy` (or the project's configured linters).
- FastAPI / Django per `project.mdc`; Pydantic models for every request and response.
- Business logic in service modules, not in route handlers.
- Settings via pydantic-settings / environment variables; never hard-code config.
- Use the ORM or parameterised queries only.
- Logging with the standard `logging` module in JSON format; no `print` in application code.
- Tests with pytest; fixtures for setup; fake data only.


